<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Ye children of men, attend to the word</l><l>So solemnly uttered by Jesus, the Lord,</l><l>And let not this message to you be in vain,</l><l>“Ye must be born again.”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Oh, ye who would enter that glorious rest,</l><l>And sing with the ransomed the song of the blest;</l><l>The life everlasting if ye would obtain,</l><l>“Ye must be born again.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
